        "text_VWH6VD": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p>Our story began with a simple yet powerful vision: to bring the relaxed, carefree vibe of the islands into homes across Singapore and beyond. </p><p>Founded in 2019, the brand quickly gained prominence for its eco-conscious ethos, using sustainable materials like reclaimed teak and natural rattan to create elegant, environmentally friendly interiors that celebrate nature’s raw beauty.<br/><br/>Island Living's design philosophy centers on creating a harmonious blend of textures and finishes. From the rustic charm of natural materials to the sun-kissed elegance solid wood, each piece is carefully selected to evoke calm and serenity. </p>",
