        "heading_MqXA6d": {
          "type": "heading",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "Why  Rattan or Teak Wood?",
            "heading_size": "h1",
            "heading_tag": "h2"
          }
        },
        "text_V8zWqg": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p>Rattan is a lightweight, eco-friendly material that's versatile and stylish—perfect for casual or boho spaces. </p><p>Teak, on the other hand, is an excellent choice for outdoor furniture due to its durability, weather resistance, and low-maintenance nature, developing a beautiful patina over time. </p><p>Together, both materials offer a blend of comfort, elegance, and long-lasting quality, making them fantastic addition to any home.</p>",
            "text_size": "typeset2",
            "secondary_color": false,
            "highlight_phrases": ""
          }
        }
      },
